  "titleEn": "Road Rage",
  "titleEs": "Conducción agresiva",
  "titleText": {
    "es": "Vale, ahora que la sensación de pérdida le atenaza, pega un frenazo.",
    "en": "Okay, now just as the loss hits him, slam on the brakes.",
    "noteEn": "The title text reveals the final step of the retaliation: after the synthesized voice makes the tailgater feel a sudden personal loss, the driver plans to brake sharply."
  },
